To configure redundancy for multicast VPN IPv4 traffic on your Nokia 7750 SR, allowing the router to share up to 8 distinct routes per prefix and receive multiple paths from BGP neighbors, use the following CLI commands:

```cli
configure router bgp add-paths
    mvpn-ipv4 send 8 receive
exit
```

**Explanation:**  
