To restrict traffic for plain BGP destinations to only RSVP-TE paths or IS-IS-created SR-LSPs, use the following configuration:

```cli
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            shortcut-tunneling
                family ipv4
                    resolution-filter rsvp sr-isis
