To configure BGP session dampening on your Nokia 7750 SR for the flapping neighbor, use the following commands. This sets an initial penalty for flapping, increases suppression time for repeated flaps, caps the maximum suppression time at 2 hours, and requires 45 minutes of stable uptime before clearing penalties:

